Description: StrawWU laptop peripherals meta — touchpad, Fn, TLP, webcam, fingerprint
 Curated laptop stack: TLP power management, libinput touchpad baseline,
 Fn key helpers (brightnessctl/acpid), fprintd fingerprint login,
 PipeWire-compatible webcam tools (v4l-utils), and device_profile curation.
 Includes strawwu-laptop-peripherals CLI for smoke/probe workflows.
